        "id": 1123814
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-25T01:09:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought about doing this, but the issue is that 1 for this bit position means \"enabled\" and chips which don\u0027t support DBANK at all , don\u0027t have this bit defined, so I would imagine it would read as 1 even for category 2 flash devices that don\u0027t support DBANK.\n\nDBANK being defined or not is implicit in the flash page size config options, so this is not a feature that can be enabled dynamically and still have things work. So having this as a macro makes sense to me.",
      "parentUuid": "fdcf015a_61746ac5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 270,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 270,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "7a0319fe389f344c51dc23b068b2f1d889349f96",
