        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-05-25T03:00:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking more along the lines of the devices where it should be enabled (we\u0027ve defined the macro), ensure that it is. I haven\u0027t read the DS, but it sounds like it could be disabled. In essence, if we\u0027re saying that these chips _should_ have DBANK enabled, make sure that they actually do.",
      "parentUuid": "5c2c7554_629e17cc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 270,
        "startChar": 5,
