      "writtenOn": "2021-05-25T15:42:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We use a config option to describe the flash page size.\n#define CONFIG_FLASH_BANK_SIZE (2 * 1024)\n\nSo DBANK being enabled or not is implicit in this config option value. Yes,DBNAK could be disabled, but it requires writing to the option bytes itself to disable.",
      "parentUuid": "323e5ff1_682ea739",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 270,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 270,
        "endChar": 16
      },
      "revId": "7a0319fe389f344c51dc23b068b2f1d889349f96",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
